[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    132[0m:[38;5;10m[49m hits), so the equivalent class of "an integer with no valid variant" is an
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    133[0m:[38;5;10m[49m out-of-range `width`/`height`. `err_25_extreme_dims` and `cfg_fuzz_dims` sweep
